@startuml 03b-seq
' 图 03B：observability 时序 — runtime commit 后 · EventSpine 中轴 · 四角度 fold。

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFAF7
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #77716B
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F7F3EC

title 图 03B · Observability 时序：runtime 驱动 → 四角度描绘
caption <color:#6E6963>案例 story-t0-to-delegate · sinceRef=snap-S0 · head=snap-S2。虚线=只读。抽象 03H。</color>

mainframe <b>定锚</b> · runtime 驱动改写 · observability 四角度描绘已 commit 的 core 世界 · never write
hide footbox

box "读客户端 · SDK/运维" #F5F1EB
  actor "Observer" as Obs
end box

box "ObservabilityService · engine/" #E5ECEE
  control "ObservabilityService" as Svc
  control "ObservationIndex" as Idx
end box

box "S0 + O2 · world/ + spine/" #DDE8F0
  control "assembleObservationWorld" as Asm
  control "buildEventSpine" as Spine
  control "ProjectionEngine" as PEng
  control "deriveEventSlice" as Slice
  control "foldFourViews" as Fold
end box

box "O3 · 四 lens（Delta 解释器）" #EDE8F0
  control "dependencyLens" as Dag
  control "resourceLens" as Pet
  control "communicationLens" as Pi
  control "structureLens" as Mor
end box

box "横切 · invariants/" #F0EDE8
  control "CrossViewInvariants" as XInv
end box

box "@cantilune/runtime · 运行驱动" #E5ECEE
  database "Store.head" as Store
  database "ChangeLog.since" as Log
  control "RunHistoryTracker" as Trk
end box

box "@cantilune/core · 协调世界" #E5EDE5
  participant "Snapshot\nRunHistory\nChange" as Core
end box

== runtime 已 commit（前提） ==

note over Store, Core #E5EDE5
  chg-001 introduce → snap-S1
  chg-002 delegate → snap-S2
  history = [Obs#001, chg-001, chg-002]
end note

== O1 · 输入装配 → ObservationWorld ==

Obs -> Svc : observeCommitted(sinceRef=snap-S0)
activate Svc
Svc -> Store : getHead() → snap-S2
Svc -> Log : since(snap-S0) → [chg-001, chg-002]
Svc -> Trk : current() → RunHistory
Svc -> Asm : assembleObservationWorld(...)
activate Asm
Asm -> Core : validateBeforeRefChain / epoch
Core --> Asm : ok
Asm --> Svc : ObservationWorld
deactivate Asm

== S0 · 脊柱构建 ==

Svc -> Spine : buildEventSpine(world)
activate Spine
Spine -> Core : rewriteSegments → SourceEvent[]
Spine --> Svc : EventSpine[chg-001, chg-002]
deactivate Spine

== O2 · 逐步切片（读 snapshot + change） ==

Svc -> PEng : project(world, spine)
activate PEng
loop 每个 SourceEvent
  PEng -> Slice : deriveEventSlice(world, event)
  activate Slice
  Slice -> Dag : DependencyDelta\naddedLinks: CollaborationLink[]
  Slice -> Pet : ResourceDelta\nupdatedCapabilities: ScopedCapability[]
  Slice -> Pi : CommunicationDelta\nopenedSessions: CommunicationSession[]
  Slice -> Mor : StructureDelta\nstep: DerivedDiagnosticView
  Slice --> PEng : ProjectionSlice
  deactivate Slice
end

== O3 · 折叠四角度 ==

PEng -> Fold : foldFourViews(slices)
activate Fold
Fold --> PEng : FourViewBundle
deactivate Fold
deactivate PEng

== 出厂门控 ==

Svc -> XInv : validate(bundle, world)
XInv --> Svc : ok

== O5 · 可选诊断压缩 ==

Svc -> Idx : attachDiagnostic(bundle)
activate Idx
note right of Idx
  compressDiagnostic(structureView)
  ≠ 四投影 derive 数据源
end note
Idx --> Svc : +diagnostic: SnapshotStats

Svc -> Idx : return bundle
Idx --> Obs : FourViewBundle\ndependency·resource·comm·structure
deactivate Svc

note over Obs, Core #F7F3EC
  <b>边界</b>
  observability 不回写 runtime
  四 View 不可用于 admit/footprint
  重放验证仍在 runtime ReplayVerifier
end note

footer 类型 03A · 状态 03C · 目录 03E · runtime 02H

@enduml
